# Agent skills

Prefer project skills under `.cursor/skills/` for lifecycle work:

- Spec / clarify: `interview-me`, `spec-driven-development`
- Plan: `planning-and-task-breakdown`
- Build: `incremental-implementation`, `frontend-ui-engineering`
- Test: `test-driven-development`
- Review / simplify: `code-review-and-quality`, `code-simplification`
- Security / perf: `security-and-hardening`, `performance-optimization`
- Ship: `shipping-and-launch`, `git-workflow-and-versioning`

Do not paste full skill bodies into rules. Read the matching `SKILL.md` when the task matches.
